        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 422,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 88,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "Usually the largest contribution to the pressure in a water column is due to the weight of the water above, or the hydrostatic pressure component. This can be made explicit in the equations by decomposing the pressure in a hydrostatic and hydrodynamic part or"
